As Chairman, I will push policies to build a stronger economy, create more good-paying jobs and protect consumers from skyrocketing costs that make it increasingly difficult to make ends meet. We'll also conduct vigorous oversight of the Trump Administration, so Washington starts to works again for the people, not special interests.
